<h2 id="trigger" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">1. Trigger</h2>

Use when the user asks to **list active learner paragraphs**, **audit paragraph inventory**, **find what the UI serves**, or includes **`actpara`** (optionally with a scope like `clitics:pronominal-verb`).

Do **not** hand-roll SQL unless the script fails — reuse the shared legit filter.

---

<h2 id="definition" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">2. Definition</h2>

A row is **active for learners** when **all** of:

| Check | Source |
|-------|--------|
| `status == door_c_pass` | `gender_paragraph_status.is_learner_visible_status` |
| `gen_finally_ok == true` | `gender_paragraph_legit.is_learner_practice_row` |
| scope **not** in `CLITICS_LEGACY_SCOPE_ALIASES` | `area_paragraph_registry` — nine-chip clitics namespaces the UI no longer queries |

This matches `get_published_exercises()` — the same path practice pages use per subarea.

---

<h2 id="run" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">3. Run the script</h2>

From repo root (requires `DATABASE_URL` in `.env`):

```bash
cd apps/api && uv run python ../../.cursor/rules/project_specific/code/actpara_list_active.py
cd apps/api && uv run python ../../.cursor/rules/project_specific/code/actpara_list_active.py --scope clitics:pronominal-verb
cd apps/api && uv run python ../../.cursor/rules/project_specific/code/actpara_list_active.py --json
```

Script path: `.cursor/rules/project_specific/code/actpara_list_active.py`

**Default output:** total count + per-scope table (count + sample ids).

**`--json`:** full list `{id, scope, n, status, gen_finally_ok, chars}`.

