<h2 id="related" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">4. Related audits</h2>

| Question | How |
|----------|-----|
| Legacy scope orphans (hidden, old namespace) | `WHERE scope IN CLITICS_LEGACY_SCOPE_ALIASES.keys()` — **not** in actpara output |
| Pipeline rejects under canonical scopes | `status != door_c_pass` or `gen_finally_ok = false` — admin history only |
| Per-subarea parity with UI | `get_published_exercises(db, scope=…)` or `--scope` on this script |

**Verified baseline (2026-09-18):** 300 total rows → **204 active** (32 scopes); **56 legacy** clitics orphans excluded; **40** canonical inactive pipeline rows excluded.
